#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom/scripts.inc:61
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom_Text_IntroSpeech"
msgid ""
"Welcome, my name is GLACIA\n"
"of the ELITE FOUR.\p"
"I've traveled from afar to HOENN\n"
"so that I may hone my ice skills.\p"
"But all I have seen are challenges by\n"
"weak TRAINERS and their POKéMON.\p"
"What about you?\p"
"It would please me to no end if I could\n"
"go all out against you!$"
msgstr ""
"欢迎，我是四天王之一，\n"
"我叫波妮。\p"
"我从远方来到丰缘地区，\n"
"是为了磨练我的冰之技艺。\p"
"可是我遇到的，全都是\n"
"弱小的训练家和他们的宝可梦。\p"
"那你又如何呢？\p"
"如果能和你全力一战，\n"
"我会非常高兴的！$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom/scripts.inc:72
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom_Text_Defeat"
msgid ""
"You and your POKéMON…\n"
"How hot your spirits burn!\p"
"The all-consuming heat overwhelms.\p"
"It's no surprise that my icy skills\n"
"failed to harm you.$"
msgstr ""
"你和你的宝可梦……\n"
"斗志燃烧得多么炽热啊！\p"
"那吞噬一切的热度\n"
"让人无法招架。\p"
"难怪我的冰之技艺\n"
"伤不到你。$"

#: data/maps/EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom/scripts.inc:79
msgctxt "EverGrandeCity_GlaciasRoom_Text_PostBattleSpeech"
msgid ""
"Advance to the next room.\p"
"And there, confirm the truly fearsome\n"
"side of the POKéMON LEAGUE.$"
msgstr ""
"前往下一个房间吧。\p"
"在那里，去见识宝可梦联盟\n"
"真正可怕的一面吧。$"
